WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Troubleshooting is a skill, not a guess. We're going to build your diagnostic
process from the ground up.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Troubleshooting scenarios lab: work through multiple simulated service calls
with different failure modes. Diagnose no-cooling, no-heating, frozen coil,
short cycling, and airflow problems using the systematic troubleshooting method.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:48.000
Here's why this matters on the job: Simulated scenarios build diagnostic
confidence before you face real customers.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:02:24.000
Watch out for these: Follow the systematic process every time. And — Document
your findings at each step

00:02:24.000 --> 00:03:00.000
You get a call — condenser fan not spinning, compressor humming. What's the
first thing you check? Answer that before you move on.

